                                                "sense_id": "3cf70f46-ec95-397e-ac0d-c7800f6f4b6b",
                                                "text": "Across the street was the well-adorned window of an underwear store. In amongst the displays of briefs, boxers and boxer-briefs, Forrest detected a square-jawed man staring straight back at him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0d657fb-bb18-426f-b03e-671577e25b14",
                                                "sense_id": "3cf70f46-ec95-397e-ac0d-c7800f6f4b6b",
                                                "text": "But right now I'm waiting at the bus stop, waiting to go to work, bundled in two jackets and a coat, briefs under boxers under sweat pants under jeans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
